DO NOT WRITE THIS

Sonia: The first step is a free consultation with my team, who take your full history and decide whether I can help. Shall I send you the link?

Nothing in the conversation has told her what this costs. Naming the call, the first step, or the team as the way in is the invitation, whether or not a link is attached, and she is being asked to spend an hour before she knows whether the thing at the end of it is affordable. The cost comes first, in a message of its own, every time.
